# This directory is not currently linked to any Vercel project. These rules
# exist so that IF it is ever deployed, internal files cannot ship by accident.
# 11_GovSite learned this the hard way: a flat static deploy makes every file
# not excluded here publicly fetchable by URL.

# README.md is internal. It names decision numbers, open legal gates, the
# unresolved purchase URL and the source-artifact hashes. Served statically it
# would be readable at /README.md by anyone who guessed the path.
README.md

# Local tooling config, not site content
.gitignore
.vercel
.env*

# Editor/OS noise
.DS_Store
Thumbs.db
